{
  "sourceLanguage": "zh-Hans",
  "strings": {
    "English": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "English"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "上午好": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Good morning"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "下午好": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Good afternoon"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "下面是用 ScreenCaptureKit 截取整个屏幕的结果，与 Zoom / Teams / Meet 等共享整屏时的取图方式相同。如果能看到提词器，说明共享整屏时对方也可能看到；请改为只共享会议窗口或标签页。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This is the whole screen captured with ScreenCaptureKit, the way Zoom, Teams or Meet capture a shared screen. If you can see the teleprompter here, others may see it when you share your entire screen; share only the meeting window or tab instead."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "会议进行中不能切换语言。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You can't change the language during a meeting."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "停止辅助后再安装 %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "End the meeting first, then install %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "共享可见性测试": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Screen-sharing visibility test"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "关闭": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Close"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "关闭提示": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dismiss"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "切换语言后，App 会保存当前内容并自动重新打开。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "After you switch languages, the app saves your work and reopens."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "取消": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cancel"
          }
        }
      }
    },
